{"book":"kinney","chapter":"testing","chapterTitle":"مدخل إلى الاختبارات","slug":"vitests-hooks-exercise","title":"تمرين","headings":[],"html":"<p>هل يمكنك أخذ اختبارات <code>Character</code> من <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/courses/testing/asymmetric-matchers-solution\">الحل السابق</a> واستخدام خطّاف <code>beforeEach</code> لإنشاء شخصية جديدة في كل مرة؟</p>\n<p>لو أردنا فعل شيء مماثل مع <code>Person</code>، فقد يبدو هكذا.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { describe, it, expect, beforeEach } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vitest&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./person.js&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">describe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Person&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> person;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">beforeEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n    person = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Grace&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hopper&#x27;</span>);\n  });\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">it</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;should create a person with a first name and last name&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(person).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toMatchObject</span>({\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">firstName</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Grace&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">lastName</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hopper&#x27;</span>,\n    });\n  });\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">it</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;should throw an error if first name or last name is missing&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Grace&#x27;</span>)).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toThrow</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;First name and last name are required&#x27;</span>);\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>()).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toThrow</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;First name and last name are required&#x27;</span>);\n  });\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">it</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;should return the full name&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(person.<span class=\"hljs-property\">fullName</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Grace Hopper&#x27;</span>);\n  });\n});\n</code></pre>\n"}